      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FCD9DD",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "## ⚠️ 3. Save to Google Sheets\n\nConnect your OWN Google Sheets credential and select your spreadsheet and tab. Create your tab with headers matching the column list in the overview note.\n\nDon't click ⋮ → Refresh — it erases the column mapping."
      },
